{% comment %}
  Homepage campaign spotlight: an HTML banner for the running campaign (big serif
  campaign name, "up to X%" and a countdown) with its best deals underneath, all linking
  to the campaign page.

  - "Up to X%" is computed like the campaign page (sections/alc-offer-page) computes its
    hero: the campaign collection's in-stock offers, plus the discounted, in-stock
    products that snippets/alc-campaign-picker adds from the campaign's categories
    (collection metafield custom.slider_subcollections). Both pages therefore show the
    same figure, and it is never a number typed into a picture.
  - The deals (12 by default, six per row on desktop, a two-row swipe below 1100px): the
    categories take turns, deepest discount first, with one product per model family on
    the first pass; the campaign's in-stock full-price products only top up. A product
    list picked in the editor replaces them. The tiles are the shared product card,
    re-skinned for the dark stage in the CSS.
  - The campaign runs inside paginate: without it Liquid only hands a loop the first 50
    products of a collection.

  Texts have built-in translations for every storefront language; filled-in settings
  override them. Styles: assets/alc-campaign-spotlight.css, countdown:
  assets/alc-campaign-spotlight.js.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign campaign = section.settings.collection
  assign lang = request.locale.iso_code | downcase | slice: 0, 2
  case lang
    when 'en'
      assign w = 'Stylish lighting|for a more beautiful home|Up to|off|Shop now|Offer ends in|day|days|hours|min|sec|Top deals|See all deals'
    when 'hu'
      assign w = 'Elegáns világítás|egy szebb otthonért|Akár|kedvezmény|Vásároljon most|Az ajánlat vége:|nap|nap|óra|perc|mp|A legnagyobb kedvezmények|Összes ajánlat'
    when 'pl'
      assign w = 'Eleganckie oświetlenie|dla piękniejszego domu|Do|rabatu|Kup teraz|Oferta kończy się za|dzień|dni|godz.|min|sek|Największe rabaty|Zobacz wszystkie oferty'
    when 'el'
      assign w = 'Κομψός φωτισμός|για ένα πιο όμορφο σπίτι|Έως|έκπτωση|Αγοράστε τώρα|Η προσφορά λήγει σε|ημέρα|ημέρες|ώρες|λεπτά|δευτ.|Οι μεγαλύτερες εκπτώσεις|Δείτε όλες τις προσφορές'
    when 'bg'
      assign w = 'Елегантно осветление|за по-красив дом|До|отстъпка|Купете сега|Офертата изтича след|ден|дни|часа|мин|сек|Най-големите отстъпки|Вижте всички оферти'
    when 'it'
      assign w = 'Illuminazione elegante|per una casa più bella|Fino al|di sconto|Acquista ora|L’offerta termina tra|giorno|giorni|ore|min|sec|Gli sconti migliori|Vedi tutte le offerte'
    when 'fr'
      assign w = 'Un éclairage élégant|pour une maison plus belle|Jusqu’à|de remise|J’en profite|L’offre se termine dans|jour|jours|h|min|s|Les plus fortes remises|Voir toutes les offres'
    when 'cs'
      assign w = 'Elegantní osvětlení|pro krásnější domov|Až|sleva|Nakoupit nyní|Nabídka končí za|den|dní|hod|min|s|Největší slevy|Zobrazit všechny nabídky'
    when 'sk'
      assign w = 'Elegantné osvetlenie|pre krajší domov|Až|zľava|Nakúpiť teraz|Ponuka končí o|deň|dní|hod|min|s|Najväčšie zľavy|Zobraziť všetky ponuky'
    when 'hr'
      assign w = 'Elegantna rasvjeta|za ljepši dom|Do|popusta|Kupi sada|Ponuda završava za|dan|dana|sati|min|sek|Najveći popusti|Pogledajte sve ponude'
    when 'de'
      assign w = 'Elegante Beleuchtung|für ein schöneres Zuhause|Bis zu|Rabatt|Jetzt shoppen|Angebot endet in|Tag|Tage|Std.|Min.|Sek.|Die größten Rabatte|Alle Angebote ansehen'
    when 'nl'
      assign w = 'Stijlvolle verlichting|voor een mooier thuis|Tot|korting|Shop nu|Aanbieding eindigt over|dag|dagen|uur|min|sec|De grootste kortingen|Bekijk alle aanbiedingen'
    else
      assign w = 'Iluminat elegant|pentru o casă mai frumoasă|Până la|reducere|Cumpără acum|Oferta se încheie în|zi|zile|ore|min|sec|Cele mai mari reduceri|Vezi toate ofertele'
  endcase
  assign t = w | split: '|'

  assign tagline_1 = section.settings.tagline_1 | default: t[0]
  assign tagline_2 = section.settings.tagline_2 | default: t[1]
  assign cta_label = section.settings.cta_label | default: t[4]
  assign deals_heading = section.settings.deals_heading | default: t[11]

  assign font = section.settings.display_font
  assign products_count = section.settings.products_count

  comment
    The gold line fits up to six capitals ("SALE", "FRIDAY") at full size; longer words
    shrink in proportion so they never run into the photo or off a phone screen.
  endcomment
  assign t2_chars = section.settings.title_2 | strip | size
  assign t2_scale = 1
  if t2_chars > 6
    assign t2_scale = 6.3 | divided_by: t2_chars | round: 3
  endif
-%}

{%- if campaign == blank -%}
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}
    <div class="page-width" style="padding: 24px 0;">Campaign spotlight: pick the campaign collection.</div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- else -%}
{{ 'alc-campaign-spotlight.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'alc-campaign-spotlight.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- if section.settings.show_products -%}
  {%- comment -%} The cards' add-to-cart needs Dawn's product-form and quick-add, like the collection grid. {%- endcomment -%}
  {{ 'quick-add.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
  <script src="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
  <script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- endif -%}
<link rel="preload" href="{{ font | font_url }}" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{{ 'alc-cs-figures.woff2' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous' }}
<style>
  {{ font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
  {%- comment -%}
    Lining figures for "up to X%": Shopify's Playfair Display only has old-style figures
    (the 4 drops below the line). A 2 KB subset of Playfair Display (OFL) with the
    lining digits mapped in, and the hyphen drawn as a true minus (the "−64%" seals),
    used for digits, % and - only.
  {%- endcomment %}
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'AlcCsFigures';
    src: url({{ 'alc-cs-figures.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2');
    font-display: swap;
    unicode-range: U+0025, U+002D, U+0030-0039;
  }
  .alc-cs-{{ section.id }} {
    --alc-cs-display: {{ font.family }}, {{ font.fallback_families }};
    --alc-cs-pt: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    --alc-cs-pb: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    --alc-cs-t2-scale: {{ t2_scale }};
  }
</style>

{%- paginate campaign.products by 250 -%}
{%- liquid
  comment
    The campaign's categories, the same list the campaign page uses.
  endcomment
  assign source_handles = ''
  for sub in campaign.metafields.custom.slider_subcollections.value
    assign source_handles = source_handles | append: sub.handle | append: ','
  endfor
  if source_handles == ''
    assign source_handles = campaign.handle
  endif
  assign source_handles = source_handles | split: ','

  comment
    Rows: "<100 - discount><order>~<product id>~<category>~<source collection>". A plain
    sort puts the deepest discount first; full-price rows start with 999 and only top up.
  endcomment
  assign deal_rows = ''
  assign fill_rows = ''
  assign shown_ids = ','
  assign order = 0
  for p in campaign.products
    if p.available == false
      continue
    endif
    assign cat = campaign.handle
    assign p_handles = p.collections | map: 'handle'
    for h in source_handles
      if p_handles contains h
        assign cat = h
        break
      endif
    endfor
    assign ord = order | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
    if p.compare_at_price > p.price
      assign pct = p.compare_at_price | minus: p.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: p.compare_at_price | round
      assign inv = 100 | minus: pct | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
      assign deal_rows = deal_rows | append: inv | append: ord | append: '~' | append: p.id | append: '~' | append: cat | append: '~' | append: campaign.handle | append: ','
    else
      assign fill_rows = fill_rows | append: '999' | append: ord | append: '~' | append: p.id | append: '~' | append: cat | append: '~' | append: campaign.handle | append: ','
    endif
    assign shown_ids = shown_ids | append: p.id | append: ','
    assign order = order | plus: 1
  endfor

  for pass_handle in source_handles
    if pass_handle == campaign.handle
      continue
    endif
    assign source = collections[pass_handle]
    if source == blank
      continue
    endif
    capture picked
      render 'alc-campaign-picker', source: source, campaign: campaign, slots: section.settings.slots, exclude: shown_ids, no_fill: true
    endcapture
    assign picked_ids = picked | strip | split: ','
    for picked_id in picked_ids
      assign wanted_id = picked_id | plus: 0
      assign found = source.products | where: 'id', wanted_id
      if found.size == 0
        continue
      endif
      assign p = found.first
      assign pct = p.compare_at_price | minus: p.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: p.compare_at_price | round
      assign inv = 100 | minus: pct | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
      assign ord = order | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
      assign deal_rows = deal_rows | append: inv | append: ord | append: '~' | append: p.id | append: '~' | append: pass_handle | append: '~' | append: pass_handle | append: ','
      assign shown_ids = shown_ids | append: p.id | append: ','
      assign order = order | plus: 1
    endfor
  endfor

  assign ranked = deal_rows | split: ',' | sort
  assign deal_count = ranked.size
  assign max_pct = 0
  if deal_count > 0
    assign max_pct = ranked.first | slice: 0, 3 | plus: 0
    assign max_pct = 100 | minus: max_pct
  endif

  comment
    The deals take turns by category: the best deal of each category, then the second
    best of each, and so on, deepest discount first within a round. A two-digit round
    number in front of the row does the ordering; near-identical products of one
    category then never sit side by side. Full-price products only top up the end.
    seen_cats starts and joins with "x" so split counts every earlier token.
  endcomment
  assign seen_cats = 'x'
  assign rr_rows = ''
  for row in ranked
    assign parts = row | split: '~'
    assign cat_token = '~' | append: parts[2] | append: '~'
    assign round = seen_cats | split: cat_token | size | plus: 99 | append: '' | slice: 1, 2
    assign seen_cats = seen_cats | append: cat_token | append: 'x'
    assign rr_rows = rr_rows | append: round | append: row | append: ','
  endfor
  assign top_rows = rr_rows | split: ',' | sort | join: ',' | append: ',' | append: fill_rows | split: ','

  assign link = section.settings.cta_link | default: campaign.url

  comment
    Countdown end: 23:59:59 Bucharest time on the end date. The server value is only a
    first paint; the script recomputes it with the real offset and hides an ended clock.
  endcomment
  assign end_date = section.settings.end_date | strip
  assign show_clock = false
  if end_date != blank
    assign end_s = end_date | append: ' 23:59:59 +0200' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign now_s = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign left_s = end_s | minus: now_s
    if left_s > 0
      assign show_clock = true
      assign c_d = left_s | divided_by: 86400
      assign c_rest = left_s | modulo: 86400
      assign c_h = c_rest | divided_by: 3600 | plus: 100 | append: '' | slice: 1, 2
      assign c_rest = c_rest | modulo: 3600
      assign c_m = c_rest | divided_by: 60 | plus: 100 | append: '' | slice: 1, 2
      assign c_s = c_rest | modulo: 60 | plus: 100 | append: '' | slice: 1, 2
    endif
  endif
-%}

<div class="alc-cs alc-cs-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="alc-cs__wrap">
    <div class="alc-cs__stage">
      <div class="alc-cs__hero">
        <span class="alc-cs__media" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- liquid
            assign img = section.settings.image
            assign img_mobile = section.settings.image_mobile | default: img
          -%}
          <picture>
            {%- if img != blank -%}
              <source
                media="(min-width: 750px)"
                srcset="{{ img | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ img | image_url: width: 1300 }} 1300w, {{ img | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
                sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 860px, 66vw"
              >
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if img_mobile != blank -%}
              <img
                class="alc-cs__img"
                src="{{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 900 }}"
                srcset="{{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w"
                sizes="(min-width: 750px) 66vw, 100vw"
                width="{{ img_mobile.width }}"
                height="{{ img_mobile.height }}"
                alt=""
                fetchpriority="high"
              >
            {%- else -%}
              <img
                class="alc-cs__img"
                src="{{ 'alc-campaign-hero.jpg' | asset_img_url: '931x' }}"
                srcset="{{ 'alc-campaign-hero.jpg' | asset_img_url: '540x' }} 540w, {{ 'alc-campaign-hero.jpg' | asset_img_url: '760x' }} 760w, {{ 'alc-campaign-hero.jpg' | asset_img_url: '931x' }} 931w"
                sizes="(min-width: 1300px) 860px, (min-width: 750px) 66vw, 100vw"
                width="931"
                height="941"
                alt=""
                fetchpriority="high"
              >
            {%- endif -%}
          </picture>
          <span class="alc-cs__shade"></span>
        </span>

        <div class="alc-cs__copy">
          <h2 class="alc-cs__title">
            <span class="alc-cs__t1 alc-cs__rise">{{ section.settings.title_1 | escape }}</span>
            <span class="alc-cs__t2 alc-cs__rise">{{ section.settings.title_2 | escape }}</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="alc-cs__tagline alc-cs__rise">
            <span>{{ tagline_1 | escape }}</span>
            <span>{{ tagline_2 | escape }}</span>
          </p>

          {%- if max_pct > 0 -%}
            <p class="alc-cs__deal alc-cs__rise">
              <span class="alc-cs__deal-pre">{{ t[2] }}</span>
              <span class="alc-cs__deal-pct">{{ max_pct }}<span class="alc-cs__deal-sign">%</span></span>
              <span class="alc-cs__deal-post">{{ t[3] }}</span>
            </p>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="alc-cs__actions alc-cs__rise">
            <a class="alc-cs__cta" href="{{ link }}">
              <span class="alc-cs__cta-pill">
                <span class="alc-cs__cta-text">{{ cta_label | escape }}</span>
                <svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </a>

            {%- if show_clock -%}
              <alc-cs-countdown class="alc-cs__clock" data-end="{{ end_date | escape }}" data-day="{{ t[6] | escape }}" data-days="{{ t[7] | escape }}">
                <span class="alc-cs__clock-label">{{ t[5] }}</span>
                <span class="alc-cs__clock-units" role="timer" aria-live="off">
                  <span class="alc-cs__unit" data-d-unit{% if c_d == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}><b data-d>{{ c_d }}</b><small data-d-label>{% if c_d == 1 %}{{ t[6] }}{% else %}{{ t[7] }}{% endif %}</small></span>
                  <span class="alc-cs__unit"><b data-h>{{ c_h }}</b><small>{{ t[8] }}</small></span>
                  <span class="alc-cs__unit"><b data-m>{{ c_m }}</b><small>{{ t[9] }}</small></span>
                  <span class="alc-cs__unit"><b data-s>{{ c_s }}</b><small>{{ t[10] }}</small></span>
                </span>
              </alc-cs-countdown>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- if section.settings.show_products -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign picked_products = section.settings.product_list
        -%}
        <div class="alc-cs__deals">
          <div class="alc-cs__deals-head">
            <h3 class="alc-cs__deals-title">{{ deals_heading | escape }}</h3>
            <a class="alc-cs__all" href="{{ link }}">
              {{- t[12] -}}
              {%- if deal_count > 0 and picked_products.size == 0 %} <span class="alc-cs__all-count">{{ deal_count }}</span>{% endif -%}
              <svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          {%- liquid
            comment
              The tiles: the editor's list, else the ranked rows in two passes. The first
              pass keeps one product per model family (the first all-caps word of the
              title, e.g. ICEBERG), so colour versions of one lamp do not fill the grid;
              the second pass tops up with whatever was skipped.
            endcomment
            if picked_products.size > 0
              assign tiles = picked_products
            else
              assign tiles = '' | split: ','
              assign tile_ids = ','
              assign families = ','
              for pass in (1..2)
                for row in top_rows
                  if tiles.size >= products_count
                    break
                  endif
                  assign parts = row | split: '~'
                  assign wanted_id = parts[1] | plus: 0
                  assign id_token = ',' | append: wanted_id | append: ','
                  if wanted_id == 0 or tile_ids contains id_token
                    continue
                  endif
                  if parts[3] == campaign.handle
                    assign found = campaign.products | where: 'id', wanted_id
                  else
                    assign found = collections[parts[3]].products | where: 'id', wanted_id
                  endif
                  if found.size == 0
                    continue
                  endif
                  if pass == 1
                    assign family = wanted_id
                    assign words = found.first.title | replace: ',', ' ' | replace: '-', ' ' | split: ' '
                    for word in words
                      if word.size < 3 or word == 'LED' or word == 'RGB' or word == 'USB' or word == 'CCT'
                        continue
                      endif
                      assign word_up = word | upcase
                      assign word_down = word | downcase
                      assign letters = word | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9'
                      if word_up == word and word_down != word and letters == word
                        assign family = word
                        break
                      endif
                    endfor
                    assign family_token = ',' | append: family | append: ','
                    if families contains family_token
                      continue
                    endif
                    assign families = families | append: family | append: ','
                  endif
                  assign tiles = tiles | concat: found
                  assign tile_ids = tile_ids | append: wanted_id | append: ','
                endfor
              endfor
            endif
          -%}
          <ul class="alc-cs__grid" role="list">
            {%- for p in tiles limit: products_count -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign skip_card_styles = true
                if forloop.first
                  assign skip_card_styles = false
                endif
              -%}
              <li class="alc-cs__item{% if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll %} scroll-trigger animate--slide-in{% endif %}"{% if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll %} data-cascade style="--animation-order: {{ forloop.index }};"{% endif %}>
                {%- render 'alc-card-product', heading_tag: 'div', card_product: p, media_aspect_ratio: 'square', show_secondary_image: true, skip_styles: skip_card_styles, section_id: section.id, quick_add: 'standard' -%}
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
            {%- comment -%} Phones and tablets: the swipe row ends with a "see all" tile. {%- endcomment -%}
            <li class="alc-cs__more">
              <a class="alc-cs__more-link" href="{{ link }}">
                {%- if deal_count > 0 and picked_products.size == 0 -%}
                  <span class="alc-cs__more-count">{{ deal_count }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="alc-cs__more-text">{{ t[12] }}</span>
                <span class="alc-cs__more-go" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
                </span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endpaginate -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Campaign spotlight",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Homepage banner for the running campaign with its best deals. \"Up to X%\" is computed from the campaign's offers, the same way as on the campaign page." },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Campaign collection" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "cta_link", "label": "Link", "info": "Empty: the campaign collection's page" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title_1", "label": "Title, first line", "default": "October" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title_2", "label": "Title, second line (gold)", "default": "Sale" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline_1", "label": "Tagline, first line", "info": "Empty: built-in text in every language" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline_2", "label": "Tagline, second line", "info": "Empty: built-in text in every language" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Button", "info": "Empty: built-in text in every language" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "end_date", "label": "Campaign end date", "info": "YYYY-MM-DD. The countdown runs to 23:59 Bucharest time and disappears once it ends. Empty: no countdown." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photo", "info": "Landscape, about 1600 px wide. The left side fades into the dark background behind the text." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_mobile", "label": "Photo on phones", "info": "Empty: the photo above" },
    { "type": "font_picker", "id": "display_font", "label": "Title font", "default": "playfair_display_n4" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Deals" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_products", "label": "Show deals", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deals_heading", "label": "Heading", "info": "Empty: built-in text in every language" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "products_count", "min": 6, "max": 24, "step": 6, "label": "Products", "default": 12, "info": "Six per row on desktop" },
    { "type": "product_list", "id": "product_list", "label": "Pick products by hand", "limit": 24, "info": "Empty: the deepest deals, taking turns by category" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "slots", "min": 4, "max": 30, "step": 1, "label": "Offers per category", "default": 15, "info": "Same value as on the campaign page, so both show the same \"up to\" figure" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Spacing" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_top", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "label": "Top padding", "default": 24, "info": "Half on phones" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "label": "Bottom padding", "default": 32, "info": "Half on phones" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Campaign spotlight" }]
}
{% endschema %}
